Wikidata dedicates its structured data to the public domain under CC0. The
labels and aliases here are that structured data, reshaped but not added to.
No further right is claimed over the selection or the arrangement; any that
might arise is waived under the same terms.

The code that produced the dataset is licensed separately, under Apache-2.0.
